 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rules, gather information, and use the gained knowledge to find new paths forward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are layers of secrets hidden in plain sight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit by bit, the lost world of the EMUUROM creatures begins to unfold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/eb0ee280dc57fc2626aa62e6aeeb33d1.poster.avif?t=1783267109\" width=1170 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/eb0ee280dc57fc2626aa62e6aeeb33d1.webm?t=1783267109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/eb0ee280dc57fc2626aa62e6aeeb33d1.mp4?t=1783267109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras/9ba018581cb5fbd88ee35eacb4ae10b6.avif?t=1783267109\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1634360/extras_big/9ba018581cb5fbd88ee35eacb4ae10b6.webp?t=1783267109 width=1560 height=110 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Study creatures and reveal hidden pathways with your trusty<i><strong> scanner beam</strong></i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse an interconnected world full of mysteries and use your scanner to solve  puzzles ranging from obvious to obscure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_